    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miyeeda Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwascheang'da Musa aba moohajeega Moabu ea ghwahita Giijeeda Nebu, bea uhuuda Bisga, afuursiinyi geat sea Yeriko. Hean goohiimsa NG'UTAMIIDA niny ng'eanyiisean, bea Gileyadi ea Dani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Naftaleesean, ea ng'eanyiida Efraimu ea Manase, ea ng'eanyiisean bea Yuda ea ghwahita basooda Biyeara, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Negebu, ea mooheeda mida moangoachiyda Yeriko bea mujiineeda mida miilayga, ea ghwahita Soari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha niny, “Nih ng'eanyiida ghayi eayeaksi habeawooda Abrahamu, ea Isaka, ea Yakobo gil, gideaba ‘gaydaadaw jeacheengaagu.’ Asi nidaahi aba gheanyangaagu, ak ea majageawsiina hoowa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghami Musa was siida gadiyeeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba hoowa bea ng'eanyiida Moabuun, gawuurji gidanyaashta ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geebung'sa niny jeeda moangoachi bea jeeda ng'eanyiida Moabu deaschi Bet-beori, ak ea manda siida nal heeda mida bung'eadaanyi ea ghoah ghamneawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa abeeda gaba gweanyeew bughala ea diktam damanda meawa, nea eara gheanyangaaschi ea mii gang'oowiidi, nea eara uurda saseadaanyi ea mii ghwasuunya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gagutu heareega fuga Israeli aba badayda Musa, aba jeeda mooheeda Moabu eawooji diktam ea damanamughuush, hean iidu goosha gutuunooda heareega ea giinyahuushooda aba badayda Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Yoshuwa orjeeda Nuni ghwanyiit guroorooda weaghuumeeda, aba gideaba goombiit Musa ak ghwayiin geatingaaschi uhuudaanyi, hean gooleeysiit fuga Israeli niny, ak gwasinda gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea mii gwardu gicha aba jeeda fuga Israeli sibaneeda uurji Musa, was dea nidaah NG'UTAMIIDA aba gheanyangaaschi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "manda dea uurji niny ajeakta NG'UTAMIIDA gwasin gwadeagwajeega ea ng'asheega deamdeameadi aba ng'eanyiida Misri, aba heeda Farao ea heeda fugaaschi sean bea gadiyeeda ea ng'eanyiidaanyi sean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba uurda sean ea aba hawunda sean ea gadiyoojiga deamdeameadi ghayi sin Musa aba madeeda fuga Israeli sean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
